WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.356
Welcome to SaloneHCM — Sierra Leone's human capital management and payroll platform.

2
00:00:05.356 --> 00:00:17.026
In this getting-started session, we'll sign in for the first time, take a tour of the dashboard, learn the navigation, and show you how to discover every feature available to you. Let's begin.

3
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:23.907
This is the sign-in page. Enter the work email and password provided by your administrator.

4
00:00:23.907 --> 00:00:31.990
If your organisation has enabled two-factor authentication, you'll also be asked for a six digit code from your authenticator app.

5
00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:35.098
Now watch as we sign in as a system administrator.

6
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:39.476
And here is your dashboard — the heart of SaloneHCM.

7
00:00:39.476 --> 00:00:48.470
Across the top you'll find live key performance indicators: total headcount, monthly payroll cost, pending leave requests, and compliance status.

8
00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:51.634
Everything updates in real time as your team works.

9
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:54.705
On the left is your navigation sidebar.

10
00:00:54.705 --> 00:01:02.068
It only shows the modules your role and your organisation's plan unlock — so what you see is always what you can use.

11
00:01:02.068 --> 00:01:07.418
Core H R sits at the top, followed by payroll and finance, then administration tools.

12
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.174
Not sure where something lives?

13
00:01:11.174 --> 00:01:24.578
Open the Feature Directory. Every module in the platform is listed here, grouped by function, with a plain-language description and a live status — available, requiring a higher plan, or restricted to administrators.

14
00:01:24.578 --> 00:01:27.370
Click any available card to jump straight in.

15
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:43.562
Finally, remember two things: your settings page controls your password and two-factor security, and the Training Center — where you found this video — holds quick reference cards, knowledge base articles, and certification quizzes for every role.

16
00:01:43.562 --> 00:01:45.050
You're ready to explore.
